  "query_preview": "..\n(Thursday Night through next Wednesday)\nIssued at 1112 AM CST Wed Nov 4 2026\n\nA short wave trough will track out of the Rockies on Friday and\nmove over Middle TN. This trough will loose its moisture by the\ntime it gets here keeping things dry. Highs Friday will be a bit \ncooler in the low to mid 60s. The big impact from the trough will\nbe the cold air that builds in behind it. We are going to see a \ncool weekend with highs only in the mid to upper 50s. Clear and \ncold conditions set in Saturday with lows in the low to mid 30s, \nsome areas over the Plateau could drop into the upper 20s. \nTroughing will remain in place for the start of next week and that\nwill keep things cool. Highs will remain in the low to mid 60s \nwith lows in the 30s. No precip chances for the extended period.",
